  "gui.smallships.dockyard.about.smallships_addon.early_cog": "The early cog is a single-masted sailing ship. A tail wind gives it a strong speed bonus, a side wind a small one. Up to six shields can be hung along its sides, three on each side, and every shield reduces the damage the ship takes. It sails faster in cold waters.",
  "gui.smallships.dockyard.about.smallships_addon.early_caravel": "The early caravel is a single-masted sailing ship. It keeps its full speed in a head wind, and a side wind gives it a small speed bonus. It keeps its full speed with a full cargo hold. It sails faster in warm waters.",
  "gui.smallships.dockyard.about.smallships_addon.rowing_boat": "A Rowing Boat",
  "gui.smallships.dockyard.about.smallships_addon.fishing_boat": "The fishing boat is a single-masted sailing ship with a net that is lowered and hauled in at the press of a key. While the net is out it kills small fish that swim into it and stows their drops and every other item drifting in it in the cargo hold. It also brings up a catch by itself from time to time, and sooner while the boat is under way.",

